{"title": "Network giant trials its first electric prime mover and heavy duty charger with battery", "link": "https://thedriven.io/2026/05/18/network-giant-trials-its-first-electric-prime-mover-and-heavy-duty-charger-with-battery/", "summary": "<a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/05/18/network-giant-trials-its-first-electric-prime-mover-and-heavy-duty-charger-with-battery/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Network giant trials its first electric prime mover and heavy duty charger with battery\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"285\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Photo-May-15-2026-11-39-16-AM-380x285.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" width=\"380\" /></a><p>Network giant's first electric prime mover will ply a route between the Hunter Valley and southern Sydney, with a local start-up coming up with a charging solution that includes battery storage.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/05/18/network-giant-trials-its-first-electric-prime-mover-and-heavy-duty-charger-with-battery/\">Network giant trials its first electric prime mover and heavy duty charger with battery</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://thedriven.io\">The Driven</a>.</p>", "published": "2026-05-18T02:49:16+00:00", "source": "The Driven", "category": "mobility", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-05-20T08:21:12.565108+00:00"}
{"title": "EV chargers to be rolled out across aged care facilities", "link": "https://thedriven.io/2026/05/18/ev-chargers-to-be-rolled-out-across-aged-care-facilities/", "summary": "<a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/05/18/ev-chargers-to-be-rolled-out-across-aged-care-facilities/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"EV chargers to be rolled out across aged care facilities\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"285\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Uniting-Pitt-Street-EV-380x285.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" width=\"380\" /></a><p>A total of 42 EV chargers is to be rolled out for the use of staff and residents at 21 different aged care facilities in New South Wales and the Australian Capital Territory.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/05/18/ev-chargers-to-be-rolled-out-across-aged-care-facilities/\">EV chargers to be rolled out across aged care facilities</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://thedriven.io\">The Driven</a>.</p>", "published": "2026-05-17T21:23:43+00:00", "source": "The Driven", "category": "mobility", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-05-20T08:21:12.565108+00:00"}
